1
00:00:08,480 --> 00:00:09,880
Kirito!

2
00:00:33,080 --> 00:00:34,100
Um, Yori?

3
00:00:38,160 --> 00:00:39,100
Thank you.

4
00:00:41,160 --> 00:00:43,120
And welcome back, Kirito.

5
00:00:43,560 --> 00:00:46,854
Sorry I took so long, and for
making you worry about me.

6
00:00:47,400 --> 00:00:48,400
Thank you, Alice.

7
00:00:50,160 --> 00:00:51,620
No, Kirito, wait!

8
00:00:51,920 --> 00:00:53,540
Don't worry, he'll be fine.

9
00:00:54,580 --> 00:00:57,717
We just have to have faith
in him, but we better hurry.

10
00:00:57,800 --> 00:00:59,800
We don't have much time left here.

11
00:01:24,160 --> 00:01:24,990
Asuna!

12
00:01:25,920 --> 00:01:28,217
Don't worry. I... I'm okay.

13
00:01:28,300 --> 00:01:30,080
The altar's closing.

14
00:01:30,360 --> 00:01:31,654
I have to get you out.

15
00:01:42,720 --> 00:01:47,400
Kirito, I have so many questions,
and even more to tell you.

16
00:01:48,600 --> 00:01:53,120
You must prevail, triumph over
that demon, and come back to me.

17
00:01:58,300 --> 00:01:59,359
I love you so far.

18
00:02:11,680 --> 00:02:13,504
I don't think I'm going to die.

19
00:02:16,700 --> 00:02:19,760
I don't think I'm going to die.

20
00:03:38,440 --> 00:03:42,157
Higa says if you're still in there
when we reach maximum acceleration,

21
00:03:42,240 --> 00:03:46,299
by the time we disconnect you here,
200 years will have passed there.

22
00:03:49,760 --> 00:03:51,820
All right, who are you?

23
00:03:52,360 --> 00:03:56,300
I'm a hunter and a thief and a destroyer.

24
00:03:56,500 --> 00:03:58,088
So what are you doing here?

25
00:03:58,180 --> 00:03:59,720
I'm hunting souls

26
00:04:01,020 --> 00:04:02,560
And who are you?

27
00:04:02,980 --> 00:04:04,520
Why are you here?

28
00:04:04,860 --> 00:04:08,140
What gives you the right
to stand in my way?

29
00:04:08,580 --> 00:04:09,760
My name...

30
00:04:10,640 --> 00:04:11,877
My name is...

31
00:04:11,960 --> 00:04:13,920
My name is...

32
00:04:29,980 --> 00:04:31,697
You're Kirito.

33
00:04:31,780 --> 00:04:33,457
Kirito the swordsman.

34
00:04:33,540 --> 00:04:36,357
My name is Kirito.

35
00:04:36,440 --> 00:04:37,780
Kirito the swordsman.

36
00:04:44,640 --> 00:04:45,757
Now it's your turn.

37
00:04:45,840 --> 00:04:47,617
I'm Gabriel.

38
00:04:47,700 --> 00:04:50,920
Gabriel Miller. Mr. Swordsman.

39
00:05:13,760 --> 00:05:15,220
Let's go, Gabriel!

40
00:05:21,320 --> 00:05:23,980
Generate all elements!

41
00:05:28,000 --> 00:05:28,830
Discharge!

42
00:06:09,580 --> 00:06:12,777
it should take those two
about five minutes to

43
00:06:12,860 --> 00:06:17,440
reach the system console
you You have three minutes.

44
00:06:17,960 --> 00:06:20,000
Try not to bore me too much.

45
00:06:21,900 --> 00:06:23,980
You're so generous with your time.

46
00:06:26,540 --> 00:06:27,370
Three minutes?

47
00:06:27,453 --> 00:06:28,640
That's all I'll need.

48
00:06:29,440 --> 00:06:30,270
Hmph.

49
00:06:42,480 --> 00:06:43,860
Thanks for the idea.

50
00:07:06,280 --> 00:07:07,900
Let's go.

51
00:07:14,280 --> 00:07:15,600
Oh, my God.

52
00:08:12,920 --> 00:08:13,750
Oh, my God!

53
00:08:19,020 --> 00:08:21,557
Up to now all I cared about was fighting

54
00:08:21,640 --> 00:08:23,817
long enough so Asuna
and Alice could get out.

55
00:08:23,900 --> 00:08:27,057
I was okay with getting
stuck here for 200 years

56
00:08:27,140 --> 00:08:32,097
but now I'm wondering why
is it because deep down

57
00:08:32,180 --> 00:08:36,597
I want to stay I mean
this is what I hope for a

58
00:08:36,680 --> 00:08:39,504
true alternate world
bigger and better and more?

59
00:08:39,720 --> 00:08:40,737
real than Aincrad.

60
00:08:40,820 --> 00:08:45,600
I didn't think what that'd do to
Asuna, Alice, my family and friends.

61
00:08:45,940 --> 00:08:46,770
How back

62
00:08:47,100 --> 00:08:51,457
home they'd cry over me while I
lived here until my soul fizzled out.

63
00:08:51,540 --> 00:08:53,640
Did I ever care about how

64
00:08:55,780 --> 00:08:56,640
they felt?

65
00:08:56,880 --> 00:08:58,557
Am I that selfish?

66
00:08:58,640 --> 00:08:59,897
No, you're not.

67
00:08:59,980 --> 00:09:03,037
You wanting to stay here
isn't for selfish reasons.

68
00:09:03,120 --> 00:09:05,360
Friends, that's not the Kirito I know.

69
00:09:06,360 --> 00:09:09,831
You care about the Underworld,
and the people you met here.

70
00:09:19,980 --> 00:09:21,860
But that's not true of him.

71
00:09:22,440 --> 00:09:24,800
He doesn't care about anyone at all.

72
00:09:25,160 --> 00:09:26,160
He's incapable.

73
00:09:27,300 --> 00:09:30,700
That's why he hunts, and
steals, and destroys.

74
00:09:32,060 --> 00:09:33,977
It's cause he's scared.

75
00:09:34,060 --> 00:09:35,300
Scared of people.

76
00:09:42,700 --> 00:09:44,406
I know what he's feeling now.

77
00:09:44,740 --> 00:09:49,520
On the brink of death, his confidence
has failed him. He's afraid.

78
00:09:50,000 --> 00:09:51,740
I think I'll have a taste.

79
00:10:10,380 --> 00:10:14,957
I'll feast on your feelings, your
memories, your mind, your soul.

80
00:10:15,040 --> 00:10:17,000
I'll gobble them all up.

81
00:10:19,140 --> 00:10:20,997
Good luck, asshole.

82
00:10:21,080 --> 00:10:24,117
You won't find any of them there.

83
00:10:24,200 --> 00:10:27,697
My body's just a vessel. I'll...

84
00:10:27,780 --> 00:10:31,740
I'll show you where my soul's at! What?

85
00:10:33,640 --> 00:10:35,380
Police, speckle auction!

86
00:10:38,160 --> 00:10:40,000
Police, speckle auction!

87
00:11:20,620 --> 00:11:22,140
It's him.

88
00:11:22,580 --> 00:11:24,940
His heart, his soul, his everything.

89
00:11:25,740 --> 00:11:26,570
Please.

90
00:11:27,400 --> 00:11:29,560
Let all of me reach Kirito, too.

91
00:11:38,780 --> 00:11:39,610
Kazutou.

92
00:11:40,200 --> 00:11:45,080
I'm sending all the strength I
have left to you, big brother.

93
00:11:52,040 --> 00:11:55,500
I'm starting to wonder,
what's all of this mean?

94
00:11:56,080 --> 00:11:58,980
You know, like to have
power and to be strong.

95
00:11:59,380 --> 00:12:00,380
You already know.

96
00:12:00,800 --> 00:12:02,153
Just search your heart.

97
00:12:02,380 --> 00:12:04,160
The answer is right there.

98
00:12:04,480 --> 00:12:06,760
A power greater than anger or hate.

99
00:12:30,200 --> 00:12:32,540
Kirito, I have a confession to make.

100
00:12:33,980 --> 00:12:36,120
I really do love Kirito.

101
00:12:37,180 --> 00:12:38,720
That makes two of us.

102
00:12:49,560 --> 00:12:53,120
Our souls are connected, so
we're always with you, Kirito.

103
00:12:53,520 --> 00:12:54,380
Even now.

104
00:12:57,300 --> 00:13:04,200
I see now, to live, to struggle, to
rise, to connect hearts and lives.

105
00:13:04,560 --> 00:13:06,900
They are what it means to be strong.

106
00:13:07,300 --> 00:13:08,600
They are proof of it.

107
00:13:31,280 --> 00:13:33,080
Eugeo, hear my prayer.

108
00:13:33,460 --> 00:13:35,940
Please protect my sister and Kirito.

109
00:13:56,980 --> 00:13:58,840
Thank you.

110
00:14:41,880 --> 00:14:42,710
Kirito!

111
00:14:43,020 --> 00:14:47,180
Though my soul has existed only a
short while as a fraudulent night,

112
00:14:47,440 --> 00:14:50,460
I know without a doubt
these feelings I have,

113
00:14:50,660 --> 00:14:54,100
these emotions surging
within me, are real!

114
00:15:01,060 --> 00:15:02,920
Katie Doe.

115
00:15:38,400 --> 00:15:41,200
Oh, my God.

116
00:16:15,180 --> 00:16:16,980
Reject your urge to kill,

117
00:16:17,260 --> 00:16:21,257
for that man's empty soul cannot be
slashed by an incarnation of murder.

118
00:16:21,340 --> 00:16:23,420
If you're scared, kid, don't be.

119
00:16:23,760 --> 00:16:25,377
With the swing of your sword,

120
00:16:25,460 --> 00:16:28,437
the weight of this world will
come crashing down on him.

121
00:16:28,520 --> 00:16:30,380
Now, boy, show me your resolve.

122
00:16:30,800 --> 00:16:34,680
My divine willpower is now
yours to wield as you see fit.

123
00:16:35,180 --> 00:16:37,100
Chirito, you must believe.

124
00:16:37,440 --> 00:16:39,977
Believe in the hearts of
all the people you love,

125
00:16:40,060 --> 00:16:42,360
and know they all love you in return.

126
00:16:49,340 --> 00:16:51,580
Stormcast Stream!

127
00:17:04,360 --> 00:17:05,360
It's over!

128
00:17:05,720 --> 00:17:06,680
Get me out!

129
00:17:33,380 --> 00:17:34,380
Go on.

130
00:17:34,540 --> 00:17:35,497
Here's your chance.

131
00:17:35,580 --> 00:17:36,410
End it.

132
00:17:36,900 --> 00:17:38,420
Thank you, Yujiho.

133
00:17:55,960 --> 00:17:58,760
You can't satisfy my
hunger with this light.

134
00:17:58,940 --> 00:18:01,058
I'll devour it like everything else.

135
00:18:01,280 --> 00:18:02,560
Like hell you will.

136
00:18:02,840 --> 00:18:05,337
The power of the human
heart scares you most.

137
00:18:05,420 --> 00:18:07,140
And now you'll choke on it.

138
00:18:12,360 --> 00:18:13,190
LAUGHTER

139
00:18:46,020 --> 00:18:49,180
I don't know.

140
00:19:14,180 --> 00:19:15,740
Thank you.

141
00:19:45,220 --> 00:19:48,020
Thank you.

142
00:20:17,920 --> 00:20:19,480
Bye you, Jill.

143
00:20:20,280 --> 00:20:21,300
Thanks again.

144
00:21:04,080 --> 00:21:07,100
Thank God, they both logged out in time.

145
00:21:09,520 --> 00:21:11,920
Hope you like my world, Alice.

146
00:21:16,060 --> 00:21:18,960
The next 200 years should be interesting.

147
00:21:20,860 --> 00:21:25,100
Asuna, Xenon, Leafa, everyone.

148
00:21:28,340 --> 00:21:29,340
But...

149
00:21:56,000 --> 00:21:57,940
I didn't go.

150
00:22:00,120 --> 00:22:01,520
Asuna.

151
00:22:16,760 --> 00:22:19,560
Thank you.

152
00:23:36,580 --> 00:23:38,227
Next time, The Time of Time.
